            "explanation": "This statement calculates the packet datasize from XDP metadata. In TUN driver XDP processing, this value is used for subsequent validation checks. Without proper bounds checking before this calculation or after, it could lead to integer underflow/overflow or buffer overflow when datasize is used to validate packet sizes against ETH_HLEN. This is a common attack surface in network drivers where untrusted packet data is processed."
